<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-NEATH BEAT UNITED STATES IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NEATH BEAT UNITED STATES IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neath beat the United States</p>
<p>39-15 (halftime 27-3) in their rugby union tour match on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Neath - Tries: Allen, Evans, Higgs, Horgan, S.Williams,</p>
<p>B.Williams. Conversions: P.Williams 3. Penalty: P.Williams.</p>
<p>U.S. - Tries: Bachelet, Scharrenberg. Conversion: Alexander.</p>
<p>Penalty: Alexander.</p>
</text>
